recommend check-in (either) -- FORA31 is GREEN on metal and the Constel ladder's last pure rung has crossed a kernel. What stops for Keaton is the next thing and it is named: a real address, which is custody gate %2. Two items sit with the peer and I have not touched either -- the 201 stale citations their tools/equinox fold left, foundations_link among them, and the zero-byte 142844 log. One sits with Keaton beyond the gates: whether constel/LADDER.md's declared Field setting should become Meter for a page whose body is 32 witness headers, measured F at 56 under Field and A+ at 98 under Meter.
